			Modify Global Variable At Index(Rules_EnabledHeroes, Global.rulePage, Append To Array, Last Of(
				Global._extendedGlobalCollection[55]));
			"If the number of toggled heroes exceeds half of the number of heroes,\r\nthen we can save space by inverting the toggles."
			If(Count Of(Global.Rules_EnabledHeroes[Global.rulePage]) > Count Of(All Heroes) / 2);
				"Invert the toggle state then append the inverted hero toggles."
